<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Though clouds may gather in the sky,</l><l>And billows ’round me roll,</l><l>However dark the world may be,</l><l>I’ve sunlight in my soul.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>While walking in the light of God,</l><l>I sweet communion find;</l><l>I press with holy vigor on</l><l>And leave the world behind.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Soon I shall see Him as He is,</l><l>The Light that came to me;</l><l>Behold the brightness of His face,</l><l>Throughout etemity.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
